{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唷，新……」", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "ht0637", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 164, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……這樣啊，還是不行嗎？」", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "ht0638", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太拍拍我的肩，一臉遺憾。", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我好像已經太喜歡美羽學姊，喜歡到糟糕的程度……」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯～沒想到你會迷戀到這種地步啊。」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "ht0639", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我自己也不敢相信。只要跟那個人在一起，我就沒辦法冷靜。」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「順帶問一下，天羽學姊昨天對你說什麼了？」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "ht0640", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……太可愛了再也不放開我。」", "text_idx": 167, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔欸……」", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "ht0641", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明明是我離不開她的說。」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過天羽學姊也相當迷戀你呢。」", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "ht0642", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是嗎……」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為你想嘛，那個天羽學姊說不放開你喔！」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "ht0643", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那個人或許也在和某人商量同樣的事。」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "ht0644", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼可能……」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「總而言之，你加油吧！人家不是都說三次定勝負嗎？」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "ht0645", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……你說的對，我也只能加油了。」", "text_idx": 166, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過也有一句話叫事不過三呢～」", "text_idx": 170, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "ht0646", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我、我會成功的啦！」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "期末考試第三天。", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "比起考試結果，我在另一方面遭遇前所未有的危機……", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 0, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽學姊、啊、啊、啊啊……」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 1, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒關係喔，射很多出來吧？我不希望你忍耐喔。」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 249, "voice": "mu1623", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是、我……」", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 3, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這樣忍耐是不行的……」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 249, "voice": "mu1624", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊！？唔唔、啊啊……」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看他一臉難受，我的胸口也好痛苦。", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "像這樣用手讓他舒服，光今天就五次了。", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明明年紀比我小卻很可靠的他，只有這種時候才會依賴我。", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 8, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾君的頂端變得這麼紅了……」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 249, "voice": "mu1625", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊、啊、啊……」", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只要像這樣搓揉，他就會發出好可愛的聲音。", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我還想聽更多，所以手上的動作停不下來。", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 12, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒關係喔，射出來吧。我會一直看著你的……」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 249, "voice": "mu1626", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈啊哈啊、哈啊……啊啊……」", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如此拼命忍耐著的他，對我來說就像是某種獎賞。", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "強迫他舒服，聽到他喊我的名字就會讓我好高興。", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊、美羽學姊……」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "性感而沙啞的聲音。", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "他失控的表情，讓我變得更大膽。", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 19, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾君，舒服嗎？」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 249, "voice": "mu1627", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……」", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "老實點頭的他好可愛，讓我想緊緊抱住。", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也沒想到自己居然會如此迷戀他。", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果他願意的話，我想一直這樣摸他。", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想一直看著他舒服的樣子。", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 25, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「第五次也要射很多出來喔……」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 249, "voice": "mu1628", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊、啊！啊啊！啊啊！」", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "每當他快到達極限，就會主動挺起腰頂著我的手。", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我知道這是他的習慣，於是我靠在他身上繼續搓揉頂端。", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 29, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就這樣射出來……在我的手裡……」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 249, "voice": "mu1629", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咕！？」", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 31, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯、嗯、可以頂得更用力一點喔……新吾君……新吾君……」", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 249, "voice": "mu1630", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔唔！？」", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 33, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……啊……出來了……射出來了喔，新吾君……好多……咻咻地射出來了……」", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 249, "voice": "mu1631", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 34, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「再更抱緊我……舒服得全部都射出來吧？」", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 249, "voice": "mu1632", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊、美羽學姊……好厲害……」", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "聽到他這麼說我好高興。", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然一開始有點害怕，但是他射出來的瞬間真的好惹人憐愛。", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "還有他癱軟喘氣的樣子，讓我的肚子深處都揪緊了。", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……但是，我不會告訴他。", "text_idx": 162, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不會說我的子宮在發麻。", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈啊……哈啊……美羽學姊……」", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "他分開我的雙腿，表情認真地注視著我。", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "光是這樣我的肚子就好難受，好想掉眼淚。", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我被擺成無法抵抗的姿勢，心中產生一個想法。", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想要他的小寶寶……", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以肚子才會這麼難受，只是看到他的臉眼淚就要流下來了。", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……當然，這種事也不會告訴他。", "text_idx": 163, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明明還沒有過初體驗，就想要對方的小孩……這樣子應該不對吧。", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咦？咦？」", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 50, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……怎麼了？」", "text_idx": 168, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 249, "voice": "mu1633", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "他狼狽地拼命用手刺激自己。", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「為什麼這種時候……」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為都是藉由我的手舒服嗎？他的那裡變小軟下了。", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然他挺腰頂向我的私密處，但是性器卻微微彎曲，沒辦法順利進入。", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對不起，美羽學姊……我……」", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "他滿臉通紅，正在想辦法讓自己變大。", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "連他這個樣子都讓我覺得可愛得受不了。", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 58, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾君，不要勉強喔？」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 249, "voice": "mu1634", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是……」", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 60, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為今天射出來好多，所以新吾君的那裡累了呢……」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 249, "voice": "mu1635", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……」", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我按住他的手，然後抱緊他。", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "他也立刻用力回抱我，抱得我都些痛了，整個人趴在我身上。", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真的……我是個丟臉的男人，對不起。」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 65, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……不是。」", "text_idx": 165, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 249, "voice": "mu1636", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一定是我的錯。", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為我沒有魅力，所以他才無法興奮，沒辦法順利完成初體驗。", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然即使這樣我也很幸福，但是我不想看到他消沉的樣子。", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 69, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉喔，新吾君……」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 249, "voice": "mu1637", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好想快點把第一次給他……", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "接受他的全部，也把我的全部獻給他……", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
